<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">{\an8}BARRI...</font>

150
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:48,210
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Barri... Barriu... Ba...</font>

151
00:08:48,590 --> 00:08:51,130
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Tôi sẽ không quay về Nanh Vuốt Dã Thú đâu.</font>

152
